<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>News</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>news
</pre>
<p>Shows the game's news, where the admins announce new areas, quests, 
changes and fixes. Read it now and then, and when you come back after a 
while away. It works even while you are asleep.
</p><p>There is more news, and talk about the game, on the boards: look at the 
board in a town square or guild to read it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>), and on 
the game's Discord, which some of the game's channels relay to (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Comm</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Comm</a>
</pre>




</div>